stateDiagram-v2
    %% Status: illustrative fictional workflow for one document revision.
    accTitle: Illustrative document revision states
    accDescr: A revision starts as a draft, can be approved or returned for changes, and ends when it is published.
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Approved: Reviewer approves revision
    Approved --> Draft: Author requests changes
    Approved --> Published: Owner publishes revision
    Published --> [*]
